ta-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\">???? [Template] - 1080x1080 Real Estate Flyer<br>├── ???? 01_TEXT &amp; CONTENT<br>│   ├── ???? 01_Header (Logo Here)<br>│   ├── ???? 02_Main Headline (Modern House For Sale)<br>│   ├── ???? 03_Price Tag Text ($1,500.00)<br>│   ├── ???? 04_Property Features Checklist<br>│   └── ???? 05_Footer CTA &amp; Contact Info<br>├── ???? 02_BUTTONS &amp; ICONS<br>│   ├── ???? [Button] Book Now White Pill Capsule (#FFFFFF)<br>│   ├── ???? Solid Magenta Bullet Point Dots<br>│   └── ???? Logo Vector House Glyph<br>├── ???? 03_IMAGE HOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── ????️ [Smart Object] Main Exterior Background - Double Click to Edit<br>│   ├── ????️ [Smart Object] Bedroom Center Diamond - Double Click to Edit<br>│   └── ????️ [Smart Object] Dining Area Bottom Diamond - Double Click to Edit<br>└── ???? 04_BACKGROUND &amp; VECTOR SHAPES<br>    ├── ???? Magenta Gradient Color Tint Layer (#C81D58 to #4A0D30)<br>    ├── ???? Rounded Diamond White Frames &amp; Shadows<br>    ├── ???? Bottom Gradient Chevron Polygon (#C81D58 to #4A0D30)<br>    └── ???? Solid White Base Canvas (#FFFFFF)</p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Approval Checklist</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Object Placeholders:</b> Convert each of the 3 image frames (Main House Exterior, Center Bedroom Rhombus, and Bottom Dining Rhombus) into dedicated, labeled <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"159\">Smart Objects</b> with clipping masks labeled <i data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"201\">\"DOUBLE CLICK TO REPLACE IMAGE\"</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vector Shapes Only:</b> Construct the rounded-corner rhombus frames, bottom gradient chevron polygon, and white CTA capsule button strictly using Photoshop\'s non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (<code data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"190\">U</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Editable Text Layers:</b> Maintain all headline typography, feature checklist items, pricing figures, phone numbers, and website links as live, unflattened type layers.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Layer Group Color Labels:</b> Mark <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">TEXT &amp; CONTENT</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Red</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">BUTTONS &amp; ICONS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">Green</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">IMAGE HOLDERS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">Yellow</b>, and <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">BACKGROUND</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">Blue</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clean File Finalization:</b> Delete all hidden test layers, temporary guide lines, and unused vector paths before exporting the production-ready <code data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"141\">.PSD</code> file.</p></li></ul><p><br></p>', NULL, '[\"uploads/task_images/task_6a83e5104cb2a.webp\"]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a83e294c0b9f.webp\",\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a83e294d4f19.webp\",\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a83e294e9607.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-psd/real-estate-house-property-instagram-post-social-media-banner-template_18220691.htm\",\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DylO9QGKanDyowB9Bg2W7C-AARzoOKui?usp=sharing\"]', 1, 10, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Me