mart Object Placeholders:</b> Convert both the middle panoramic city skyline image and the lower blurred background into dedicated <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"128\">Smart Objects</b> labeled <i data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"150\">\"DOUBLE CLICK TO REPLACE IMAGE\"</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vector Shapes Only:</b> Construct the central rounded-bottom charcoal card, the white border stroke, the \"OUR SERVICES\" pill button, and the footer icon badges strictly using Photoshop\'s non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (<code data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"219\">U</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Editable Text Layers:</b> Maintain all headline typography, paragraph copy, service checklist items, button labels, and footer contact numbers as live, native editable type layers.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Layer Group Color Labels:</b> Mark <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">TEXT &amp; CONTENT</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Red</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">BUTTONS &amp; ICONS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">Green</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">IMAGE HOLDERS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">Yellow</b>, and <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">BACKGROUND</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">Blue</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clean File Finalization:</b> Delete all hidden test layers, empty groups, and temporary guide lines before exporting the production-ready <code data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"134\">.PSD</code> file.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a852784a6bd9.webp\"]', '[]', 1, 2, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 5374, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XSTlEaew1PPrk3skz0cxNwiO2kmW9T0c?usp=sharing', '2026-08-19 03:49:33', '2026-08-26 07:19:47', '2026-08-19 08:47:15', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-19', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-19 08:47:15', NULL, NULL),
