 For Sale)<br>│   ├── 📁 03_Description Copy<br>│   ├── 📁 04_Features 3-Column Grid Checklist<br>│   └── 📁 05_Footer Contact &amp; Website Details<br>├── 📁 02_BUTTONS &amp; ICONS<br>│   ├── 🎨 [Button] Book Now Dark Rounded Box (#2B323D)<br>│   ├── 📁 Terracotta Feature Checkmark Glyphs (#9C4235)<br>│   ├── 📁 Contact Icon Badges (Phone &amp; Globe)<br>│   └── 📁 Dot Matrix Grids (Left &amp; Right)<br>├── 📁 03_IMAGE HOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Villa Pool Exterior - Double Click to Edit<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Inset 01 Kitchen - Double Click to Edit<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Inset 02 Living Room - Double Click to Edit<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Inset 03 Bedroom - Double Click to Edit<br>└── 📁 04_BACKGROUND &amp; VECTOR SHAPES<br>    ├── 🎨 3 Rounded Inset Photo White Frames &amp; Shadows<br>    ├── 🎨 Center Dark Slate Banner Container (#2B323D)<br>    ├── 🎨 Top-Left White Logo Card<br>    └── 🎨 Solid White Lower Canvas Base (#FFFFFF)</p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Approval Checklist</b></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Object Placeholders:</b> Convert each of the 4 photos (Top Luxury Villa with Pool, Inset Kitchen, Inset Living Room, Inset Bedroom) into separate, dedicated <b data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"159\">Smart Objects</b> clipped to their respective vector masks labeled <i data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"222\">\"DOUBLE CLICK TO REPLACE IMAGE\"</i>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vector Shapes Only:</b> Construct the middle dark slate polygon container, inset photo rounded cards, CTA button, and feature checkmark icons strictly using Photoshop\'s non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (<code data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"201\">U</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Editable Text Layers:</b> Maintain all headline phrases, descriptive paragraphs, 3-column feature items, button copy, and footer phone numbers as live, native editable type layers.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Layer Group Color Labels:</b> Mark <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">TEXT &amp; CONTENT</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Red</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">BUTTONS &amp; ICONS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">Green</b>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">IMAGE HOLDERS</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">Yellow</b>, and <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">BACKGROUND</code> in <b data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">Blue</b>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clean File Finalization:</b> Delete all hidden test layers, empty groups, and temporary guide lines before saving the final production-ready <code data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"137\">.PSD</code> file.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a868ee25a330.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-psd/real-estate-house-property-instagram-post-square-web-banner-promo-template_15433449.htm\"]', 1, 2, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 4039, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HSmJX8ldFAfnIi7MHMfF4aqDBDg36X2R?usp=drive_link', '2026-08-20 05:22:07', '2026-08-26 07:19:47', '2026-08-20 07:39:18', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-20', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-20 08:50:31', NULL, NULL);
