mp; CONTENT in Red, BUTTONS &amp; ICONS in Green, IMAGE HOLDERS in Yellow, and BACKGROUND in Blue.<br><br>Clean File Finalization: Delete all hidden test layers, empty groups, and temporary guide lines before saving the final production-ready .PSD file.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a86aca8b4481.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-psd/real-estate-property-instagram-post-social-media-banner-design-template_79561692.htm\"]', 1, 8, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 0, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RlApvXzqDPzwd3tprG_WNxrbPU2F7sCH?usp=sharing', '2026-08-20 07:29:34', '2026-08-22 05:47:50', '2026-08-22 05:09:28', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-20', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-22 05:47:50', NULL, NULL),
