ase\",<br>      \"font_weight\": 700,<br>      \"font_size_px\": 16,<br>      \"text_color\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>      \"button_shape\": \"Pill / Rounded Capsule\",<br>      \"button_gradient\": \"Linear (#434E9B to #283584)\"<br>    },<br>    \"contact_group\": {<br>      \"icon\": {<br>        \"description\": \"Purple phone handset outline with radiating call waves\",<br>        \"icon_glyph\": \"\\\\f095\",<br>        \"color\": \"#434E9B\"<br>      },<br>      \"label\": {<br>        \"text\": \"CALL US FOR DETAILS\",<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"font_style\": \"Bold Uppercase\",<br>        \"font_weight\": 700,<br>        \"font_size_px\": 12,<br>        \"text_color\": \"#6C727F\",<br>        \"letter_spacing_px\": 1<br>      },<br>      \"phone_number\": {<br>        \"text\": \"+000 1234 5678\",<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"font_style\": \"Black\",<br>        \"font_weight\": 900,<br>        \"font_size_px\": 22,<br>        \"text_color\": \"#2B2E3A\"<br>      }<br>    }<br>  },<br>  \"decorative_background_shapes\": [<br>    {<br>      \"element\": \"Deep blue-to-indigo diagonal polygon container spanning upper and left fields\",<br>      \"gradient\": \"Linear (#434E9B to #283584)\",<br>      \"position\": \"Upper-Left to Center\"<br>    },<br>    {<br>      \"element\": \"Clean white base canvas forming lower diagonal field\",<br>      \"position\": \"Bottom-Left to Bottom-Right (#FFFFFF)\"<br>    }<br>  ]<br>}</p><p><br></p><p>Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)<br><br>Montserrat Font Family: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat<br><br>Open Sans Font Family: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans<br><br>Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)<br><br>FontAwesome Official Download: https://fontawesome.com/download<br><br>Phone Call Icon: Flaticon SVG Link | Glyph: \\f095<br><br>Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources<br><br>Modern Suburban Exterior at Dusk: https://unsplash.com/s/photos/suburban-house<br><br>Real Estate Exterior Photography: https://www.pexels.com/search/real%20estate%20exterior/<br><br>Photoshop Layer Organization Guide for 100% Freepik Approval<br><br>Layer Group Hierarchy Structure</p><p><br></p><p>📁 [Template] - 1080x1080 Real Estate Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_TEXT &amp; CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 01_Header (Logo Text)<br>│   ├── 📁 02_Main Headline Block (Home FOR SALE)<br>│   ├── 📁 03_Family Shelter Tagline Copy<br>│   └── 📁 04_Footer Contact Details &amp; Phone<br>├── 📁 02_BUTTONS &amp; ICONS<br>│   ├── 🎨 [Button] Book Now Blue Pill (#434E9B to #283584)<br>│   └── 📁 Vector Phone Icon Glyph<br>├── 📁 03_IMAGE HOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Right Perspective House Photo - Double Click to Edit<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] House Background Silhouette - Double Click to Edit<br>└── 📁 04_BACKGROUND &amp; VECTOR SHAPES<br>    ├── 🎨 Angled Perspective White Border Frame<br>    ├── 🎨 Deep Blue Diagonal Polygon Container (#434E9B to #283584)<br>    └── 🎨 Solid White Base Canvas (#FFFFFF)</p><p><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"11\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Approval Checklist</strong></p><ul data-path-to-node=\"12\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Smart Object Placeholders:</strong> Convert the right-hand angled house image into a dedicated <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"86\">Smart Object</strong> clipped to the trapezoid/perspective vector mask labeled <em data-path-to-node=\"12,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"156\">\"DOUBLE CLICK TO REPLACE IMAGE\"</em>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Vector Shapes Only:</strong> Construct the angled frame border, deep blue diagonal polygon background, and CTA pill button strictly using Photoshop\'s non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (<code data-path-to-node=\"12,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"177\">U</code>).</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Editable Text Layers:</strong> Maintain all typography (headline, tagline copy, CTA text, and phone numbers) as live, unflattened type layers.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Layer Group Color Labels:</strong> Mark <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"31\">TEXT &amp; CONTENT</code> in <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"49\">Red</strong>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">BUTTONS &amp; ICONS</code> in <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"73\">Green</strong>, <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">IMAGE HOLDERS</code> in <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">Yellow</strong>, and <code data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"109\">BACKGROUND</code> in <strong data-path-to-node=\"12,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"123\">Blue</strong>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clean File Finalization:</strong> Delete all hidden test layers, empty groups, and temporary guide lines before saving the final production-ready <code data-path-to-node=\"12,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"137\">.PSD</code> file.</p></li></ul><p><br></p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a86be370fd0f.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/premium-psd/real-estate-social-media-post-banner-template_25240994.htm\"]', 1, 2, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 1210, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-_c1XxtSJuqTtj5C7zQXbo317T00SJXi?usp=drive_link', '2026-08-20 08:43:40', '2026-08-26 07:19:47', '2026-08-20 11:02:11', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-20', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-20 11:10:39', NULL, NULL);
