(185, 'Flyer 01', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Corporate Marketing / Creative Studio A4 Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_green\": \"#63C730\",<br>    \"secondary_dark_green\": \"#1E8B38\",<br>    \"dark_overlay\": \"#242526\",<br>    \"text_dark_grey\": \"#333333\",<br>    \"text_body_grey\": \"#888888\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 700, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Headlines, subheadlines, bold accents\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body text, bullet points\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"hero_top_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"City building/skyscraper image with a dark transparent overlay covering the left and top portions.\",<br>      \"side_accent\": \"Solid dark vertical bar on the left edge.\",<br>      \"side_text\": \"Vertical rotated text reading \'FLYER 02 D 1 2\'\",<br>      \"logo_block\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Top Left\",<br>        \"icon\": \"Green and white abstract geometric icon inside a dark circle\",<br>        \"text_1\": \"COMPANY LOGO (Small, tracked out)\",<br>        \"text_2\": \"Mareting (Bold)\"<br>      },<br>      \"main_headline\": {<br>        \"text\": \"CREATIVE\\nSTUDIO WORK\\nFLYER DESIGN\",<br>        \"accent\": \"Short horizontal green line under \'WORK\'\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"dynamic_curve_divider\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Middle transition\",<br>      \"description\": \"Three overlapping, sweeping curved vector shapes creating depth through drop shadows.\",<br>      \"layers\": [<br>        \"Top Curve: Bright Green\",<br>        \"Middle Curve: Dark Forest Green\",<br>        \"Base Curve: White (Forms the background for the lower content)\"<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"content_lower_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"Solid white formed by the base curve\",<br>      \"sub_headline\": \"YOUR PRESENTATION TEXT HERE (Small, uppercase)\",<br>      \"primary_title\": \"EXCELLENT IDEA (\'EXCELLENT\' in green, \'IDEA\' in dark grey)\",<br>      \"left_column\": {<br>        \"intro\": \"Nunc dignissim risus id metus. (Bold)\",<br>        \"paragraph\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit...\"<br>      },<br>      \"right_column\": {<br>        \"title\": \"ALL SERVICES\",<br>        \"list\": \"Bullet points with small green circular markers\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Bottom edge\",<br>      \"left\": {<br>        \"qr_code\": \"Square QR code graphic\",<br>        \"text\": \"Small descriptive legal/contact text block next to QR\"<br>      },<br>      \"right\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Bright green curved polygon anchored to bottom right corner\",<br>        \"text\": \"Creative Concept / UNDER SIR LOREM IPSUM (White text)\"<br>      }<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```📁 [Template] - Creative Studio Flyer Design<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Header Text<br>│   │   ├── T COMPANY LOGO<br>│   │   ├── T Mareting<br>│   │   ├── T CREATIVE<br>│   │   ├── T STUDIO WORK<br>│   │   └── T FLYER DESIGN<br>│   ├── 📁 Middle Headlines<br>│   │   ├── T YOUR PRESENTATION TEXT HERE<br>│   │   ├── T EXCELLENT<br>│   │   └── T IDEA<br>│   ├── 📁 Left Column Text<br>│   │   ├── T Nunc dignissim risus id metus.<br>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...<br>│   ├── 📁 Right Column Services<br>│   │   ├── T ALL SERVICES<br>│   │   ├── T SERVICE POINT ONE<br>│   │   ├── T SERVICE POINT TWO<br>│   │   ├── T SERVICE POINT THREE<br>│   │   ├── T SERVICE POINT FOUR<br>│   │   └── T SERVICE POINT FIVE<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Text<br>│       ├── T © 2023 Creative Studie. All rights reserved...<br>│       ├── T Creative Concept /<br>│       └── T UNDER SIR LOREM IPSUM<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BULLETS<br>│   ├── 📁 Logo Icon (Green/Black geometric circle)<br>│   ├── 📁 Service Bullets (5x Bright Green circle layers)<br>│   └── 📁 QR Code Placeholder (Smart Object + Green border frame)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Skyscraper Hero Image - Replace Here<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bright Green Header Underline<br>│   ├── 🎨 Top Left Logo Background Curve (Dark Grey)<br>│   ├── 📁 Center Dividing Waves<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Top Bright Green Wave <br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Middle Dark Green Wave (With Drop Shadow)<br>│   │   └── 🎨 Base White Wave (With Drop Shadow)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bottom Left Footer Bar (Dark Grey)<br>│   └── 🎨 Bottom Right Footer Curve (Bright Green)<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid Base Canvas (#FFFFFF)<br><br></p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8bca512b41f.webp\",\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8bca514049c.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/marketing-flyer-template_7057029.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=0&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 6, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 6985, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xqFjK2MAbKnhF6von-ecz2chrgruy6zf?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:39:50', '2026-08-26 07:57:33', '2026-08-24 06:06:12', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-25 10:02:46', NULL, NULL),
(186, 'FLYER 02', '<p>Here is a highly commercial, **Sharp Geometric Variant** of the original red and orange corporate flyer.<br><br>To make this a top-tier, modern microstock asset, this layout replaces the dated, soft organic waves with bold, sharp diagonal cuts. Diagonal layouts are incredibly popular in the corporate category because they convey momentum, precision, and a forward-thinking aesthetic.<br><br>The hero image is shifted to the right, sliced by a sharp diagonal line, while the left side uses a solid red polygon to anchor the main headline and logo. All original text, colors, and branding elements remain exactly the same.<br><br>### **JSON Blueprint: Geometric Diagonal Variant**<br><br>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Corporate Business A4 Flyer Template - Modern Diagonal Variant\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_red\": \"#B90000\",<br>    \"secondary_dark_red\": \"#8B0000\",<br>    \"accent_orange\": \"#FF8C00\",<br>    \"text_dark_grey\": \"#333333\",<br>    \"text_light_grey\": \"#999999\",<br>    \"footer_grey\": \"#D3D3D3\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"hero_and_header_section\": {<br>      \"layout_style\": \"Diagonal split across the top 55% of the canvas\",<br>      \"left_polygon\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large solid red (#B90000) diagonal wedge filling the top-left and angling down to the right\",<br>        \"logo\": {<br>          \"position\": \"Top-left corner, inside the red polygon (Logo text inverted to white)\",<br>          \"icon\": \"Two overlapping diamonds (orange and white) with a white curved swoosh\",<br>          \"brand_name\": \"YOUR LOGO\",<br>          \"slogan\": \"YOUR SLOGAN HERE\"<br>        },<br>        \"headline_group\": {<br>          \"position\": \"Middle-left, anchored inside the red polygon\",<br>          \"main_text\": \"WE ARE YOUR BEST CHOICE (White, italicized caps)\",<br>          \"sub_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, (White)\"<br>        }<br>      },<br>      \"right_image\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large triangular wedge filling the top-right\",<br>        \"image\": \"Grayscale city skyscrapers (masked to the diagonal cut)\",<br>        \"accent_stroke\": \"Thick orange (#FF8C00) diagonal line separating the red polygon and the image\",<br>        \"floating_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur (White, right-aligned, floating in the top-right corner of the image)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_content_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Lower 45% of the canvas on a solid white base\",<br>      \"heading_block\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Centered just below the diagonal cut\",<br>        \"main_heading\": \"WHO WE ARE? (Dark Grey)\",<br>        \"body_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt. Ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat volutpat.\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"services_columns\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Centered below the \'WHO WE ARE?\' paragraph\",<br>      \"sub_heading\": \"Our Services (Orange, centered above columns)\",<br>      \"layout\": \"Three equal columns separated by thin vertical grey lines\",<br>      \"columns\": [<br>        {<br>          \"number\": \"01\",<br>          \"title\": \"Aliquam sit amet (Orange, italic)\",<br>          \"text\": \"ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum id tortor porta, eleifend purus vel, sagittis purus.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"number\": \"02\",<br>          \"title\": \"Aliquam sit amet (Orange, italic)\",<br>          \"text\": \"ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum id tortor porta, eleifend purus vel, sagittis purus.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"number\": \"03\",<br>          \"title\": \"Aliquam sit amet (Orange, italic)\",<br>          \"text\": \"ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum id tortor porta, eleifend purus vel, sagittis purus.\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Absolute bottom margin\",<br>      \"background\": \"Solid light grey (#D3D3D3) horizontal band\",<br>      \"text_line_1\": \"CONTACT US FOR MORE INFORMATION\",<br>      \"text_line_2\": \"Call us : +445368792  Web : www.yourbusiness.com\"<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>---<br><br>### **Your Master Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>I am strictly maintaining your exact layer structure, spelling, and folder organization. The visual layout has been modernized, but the PSD file framework remains identical to your trusted DNA.<br><br>```text<br>📁 Logo<br>├── 🖼️ &gt;&gt; Dubble Click Here (Overlapping Diamonds &amp; Swoosh Logo Icon)<br>├── T YOUR LOGO<br>└── T YOUR SLOGAN HERE<br><br>📁 OFFERE<br>└── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur (Right-aligned text floating over image)<br><br>📁 Headline<br>├── T WE ARE YOUR BEST CHOICE<br>├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer... <br>├── 🎨 Line (Hidden or unused in this specific layout)<br>├── T WHO WE ARE?<br>└── 📁 Bg<br>    └── 🎨 Bg (Large solid red diagonal polygon wedge)<br><br>📁 Top Image<br>└── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt;Double Click Here (B&amp;W Skyscraper image, masked to a sharp diagonal cut)<br><br>📁 Small Image<br>├── 📁 Image-3 (Service 03 Column)<br>│   ├── 📁 Text<br>│   │   ├── T 03<br>│   │   ├── T Aliquam sit amet<br>│   │   └── T ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum...<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bg (Hidden)<br>│   └── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt; Double Click Here (Hidden)<br>├── 📁 Image-2 (Service 02 Column)<br>│   ├── 📁 Text<br>│   │   ├── T 02<br>│   │   ├── T Aliquam sit amet<br>│   │   └── T ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum...<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bg (Hidden)<br>│   └── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt; Double Click Here (Hidden)<br>└── 📁 Image-1 (Service 01 Column)<br>    ├── 📁 Text<br>    │   ├── T 01<br>    │   ├── T Aliquam sit amet<br>    │   └── T ipsum, nec congue arcu. Vestibulum...<br>    ├── 🎨 Bg (Hidden)<br>    └── 🖼️ &lt;&lt;&lt; Double Click Here (Hidden)<br><br>📁 About Property<br>├── T Our Services (Orange Subheading)<br>├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Paragraph under WHO WE ARE?)<br>└── 📁 Under Line<br>    ├── 🎨 Shape 2 (Right vertical grey divider line)<br>    └── 🎨 Shape 1 (Left vertical grey divider line)<br><br>📁 For sale &amp; Prize<br>├── T (Hidden text layer)<br>└── T (Hidden text layer)<br><br>📁 QR Code<br>├── 🖼️ Qr Code (Hidden placeholder)<br>└── 🎨 Rectangle 6 (Hidden placeholder)<br><br>📁 Get in touch<br>├── T CONTACT US FOR MORE INFORMATION<br>├── T Call us : +445368792 <br>├── T Web : www.yourbusiness.com<br>├── T (Hidden text layer)<br>└── 📁 Line<br>    ├── 🎨 Shape 6 copy (Thick orange diagonal stroke line bordering the image)<br>    ├── 🎨 Shape 6 (Hidden or unused in this variant)<br>    └── 🎨 Shape 1 (Solid light grey footer background rectangle)<br><br>📁 Background<br>└── 🎨 Background Color (Solid White Base)<br><br>```</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8be4946f650.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/abstract-business-flyer-template_5336450.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=1&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 6, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'In Progress', 0, 'Paused', NULL, 13, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xCNBlxo-Rc6ezkjvMKW8w1R09ZdKj8GV?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:41:00', '2026-08-25 06:43:19', '2026-08-24 11:36:14', 'Some requested assets/files are missing from the submission. Please include them.\r\n\r\nThere are spelling or grammatical errors in the copy. Please review and correct them.', NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-25 04:25:10'),
(187, 'FLYER 03', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Travel &amp; Tour Agency A4 Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_teal\": \"#00A8B5\",<br>    \"primary_dark_blue\": \"#0B55A4\",<br>    \"accent_orange\": \"#FF9900\",<br>    \"accent_green\": \"#4CAF50\",<br>    \"text_dark\": \"#333333\",<br>    \"text_teal\": \"#00A8B5\",<br>    \"text_white\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 700, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main title, callout labels, contact numbers\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Caveat\",<br>        \"weights\": [700],<br>        \"usage\": \"Handwritten script headline (\'Travel now!\')\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body paragraphs, sub-headers\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"header_hero_section\": {<br>      \"background_gradient\": \"Convex curved wave with a cyan-to-deep-blue horizontal gradient\",<br>      \"top_left_callout\": {<br>        \"badge_shape\": \"Orange rounded rectangle pill\",<br>        \"badge_text\": \"REACH US AT! (White, Bold)\",<br>        \"phone_number\": \"+123 456 7890 (Yellow/Orange, Bold)\"<br>      },<br>      \"center_headline_group\": {<br>        \"sub_text\": \"KNOW YOURSELF (White, Uppercase, Tracked out)\",<br>        \"script_headline\": \"Travel now! (White, Stylized Handwritten Script)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_content_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"Solid White base with sweeping orange curved vector swooshes in the right margin\",<br>      \"main_headline\": {<br>        \"line_1\": \"LET\'S (Teal, Black/Bold)\",<br>        \"line_2\": \"TRAVEL (Teal, Black/Bold)\",<br>        \"sub_line\": \"PLAN YOUR HOLIDAY (Teal, Medium, Tracked out)\"<br>      },<br>      \"body_paragraph\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat volutpat.\"<br>    },<br>    \"circular_image_gallery\": {<br>      \"image_1\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large circle with thick white border outline and soft shadow\",<br>        \"position\": \"Lower-Left\",<br>        \"content_description\": \"Historic European city architecture / colorful buildings\"<br>      },<br>      \"image_2\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Medium circle with thick white border outline and soft shadow\",<br>        \"position\": \"Center-Right (intersecting the larger circle)\",<br>        \"content_description\": \"Gothic cathedral / historic stone landmark\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"price_pin_and_footer\": {<br>      \"large_map_pin\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Giant orange location pin graphic occupying the bottom-right quadrant\",<br>        \"inner_circle\": \"Teal circular badge with white outer stroke\",<br>        \"badge_text\": \"STARTS FROM (White, Small)\\n$399 (White, Bold/Large)\",<br>        \"icon\": \"White airplane silhouette with upward thrust trail\"<br>      },<br>      \"bottom_left_contact\": {<br>        \"badge\": \"Green rounded capsule with \'GET IN TOUCH\'\",<br>        \"phone\": \"+123-456-555 (Dark, Bold)\",<br>        \"email\": \"youremail@domain.com (Grey, Regular)\"<br>      }<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>**Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)**<br><br>* **Montserrat Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat)<br>* **Caveat Font (Script)**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Caveat](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Caveat)<br>* **Open Sans Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans)<br><br>**Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)**<br><br>* **FontAwesome Official Download**: [https://fontawesome.com/download](https://fontawesome.com/download)<br>* **Airplane Flying Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/airplane_723955) | Glyph: `\\f072`<br>* **Phone Call Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/telephone_724664) | Glyph: `\\f095`<br>* **Location Pin Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/placeholder_684809) | Glyph: `\\f3c5`<br><br>**Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources (Unsplash)**<br><br>* **European Historic City Center**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/european-old-town](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://unsplash.com/s/photos/european-old-town)<br>* **Gothic Historic Cathedral**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/gothic-cathedral](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/gothic-cathedral)<br><br>---<br><br>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Travel Tour Agency A4 Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Top Header Text<br>│   │   ├── T REACH US AT!<br>│   │   ├── T +123 456 7890<br>│   │   ├── T KNOW YOURSELF<br>│   │   └── T Travel now! (Script)<br>│   ├── 📁 Main Title &amp; Description<br>│   │   ├── T LET\'S TRAVEL<br>│   │   ├── T PLAN YOUR HOLIDAY<br>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...<br>│   ├── 📁 Pricing Badge Text<br>│   │   ├── T STARTS FROM<br>│   │   └── T $399<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Contact<br>│       ├── T GET IN TOUCH<br>│       ├── T +123-456-555<br>│       └── T youremail@domain.com<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 White Airplane Silhouette &amp; Trail Vector<br>│   ├── 📁 Green \'GET IN TOUCH\' Capsule Pill Shape<br>│   └── 📁 Orange Top-Left \'REACH US AT!\' Pill Shape<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Large Left Circle (Old Town) - Double Click to Edit<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Medium Center Circle (Cathedral) - Double Click to Edit<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Giant Orange Location Pin Background Shape<br>│   ├── 🎨 Pin Center Teal Circle &amp; White Border Stroke<br>│   ├── 🎨 Large Left Circle Frame (White Stroke + Shadow)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Medium Right Circle Frame (White Stroke + Shadow)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Right Margin Sweeping Orange Swooshes<br>│   └── 🎨 Top Header Cyan-to-Blue Curved Gradient Banner<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid White Canvas Base (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Freepik Approval Quality Checklist**<br><br>* **Smart Objects:** Convert both circular photo placeholders into separate **Smart Objects** clipped to circular vector masks with layer styles (`Drop Shadow` and `Stroke`) applied externally.<br>* **True Vectors:** Construct the giant orange location pin, the sweeping background wave, the top gradient header, and the airplane thrust trails strictly using Photoshop Vector Shape Tools (`U`).<br>* **Editable Typography:** Keep all textual elements—especially the stylized script *\"Travel now!\"* and the numeric badges—as live, editable font layers.<br>* **Pre-Press Standard:** Ensure the document color profile is set to **CMYK / 300 DPI** with a full **3mm bleed** coverage on all four outer margins.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8c1e726605d.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/blue-orange-minimal-travel-flyer-template_41981864.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=2&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 6, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Rejected', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 74608, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xqFjK2MAbKnhF6von-ecz2chrgruy6zf?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:41:58', '2026-08-26 07:57:33', '2026-08-25 07:23:33', 'Please fix the alignment and spacing issues across the main layout. Ensure margins are consistent.', NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-25 09:25:07'),
(188, 'FLYER 04', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Digital Marketing Agency A4 Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_yellow\": \"#FFC400\",<br>    \"primary_dark_slate\": \"#232F3E\",<br>    \"text_dark\": \"#232F3E\",<br>    \"text_grey\": \"#666666\",<br>    \"text_white\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 700, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Headlines, brand name, section titles, contact numbers\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body paragraphs, subtitle tags, contact labels\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"header_and_hero_section\": {<br>      \"top_left_logo\": {<br>        \"box\": \"Yellow rounded square badge with \'YOUR LOGO\' text\",<br>        \"brand_name\": \"BRAND NAME (Yellow &amp; Dark Grey)\",<br>        \"slogan\": \"SLOGAN HERE (Dark Grey)\"<br>      },<br>      \"upper_right_hero_image\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large fluid wave/crescent shape occupying the top-right corner, framed by sweeping yellow vector curves\",<br>        \"image_content\": \"Modern corporate boardroom / conference table tinted with a warm yellow/amber overlay\"<br>      },<br>      \"left_headline_card\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Rounded rectangle card overlapping the night city skyline photo\",<br>        \"image_content\": \"Aerial night view of illuminated city skyscrapers\",<br>        \"headline_group\": {<br>          \"line_1\": \"DIGITAL (White, Semi-bold)\",<br>          \"line_2\": \"MARKETING (Yellow, Bold)\",<br>          \"line_3\": \"AGENCY (White, Bold)\",<br>          \"accent\": \"Short horizontal yellow bar under AGENCY\"<br>        }<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_content_section\": {<br>      \"left_contact_pill\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Pill / Rounded capsule shape in solid yellow anchored to the left margin\",<br>        \"title\": \"Contract (Dark Grey, Bold - Note: typo in original layout)\",<br>        \"subtitle\": \"your number here (Dark Grey, Regular)\"<br>      },<br>      \"right_about_section\": {<br>        \"heading\": \"About Us (\'About\' in Dark Grey, \'Us\' in Yellow)\",<br>        \"underline\": \"Thin horizontal yellow divider line\",<br>        \"body_text\": \"It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged...\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"services_cards_section\": {<br>      \"layout\": \"Three equal horizontal rounded cards with dark slate background (#232F3E)\",<br>      \"cards\": [<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Gear/Cog outline (White)\",<br>          \"title_1\": \"Business (White)\",<br>          \"title_2\": \"Concept (Yellow)\",<br>          \"body\": \"It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Globe outline (White)\",<br>          \"title_1\": \"Market (White)\",<br>          \"title_2\": \"Analysis (Yellow)\",<br>          \"body\": \"It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Envelope/Mail outline (White)\",<br>          \"title_1\": \"Marketing (White)\",<br>          \"title_2\": \"Stetegy (Yellow - Note: typo in original layout)\",<br>          \"body\": \"It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged.\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"layout\": \"Dual-tone split footer bar\",<br>      \"left_dark_pill\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Dark slate rounded pill container spanning left and center\",<br>        \"col_1\": \"Email icon + yourname@gmail.com / Web icon + www.websitename.com\",<br>        \"col_2\": \"Location pin icon + your address here 1 / your address here 2\"<br>      },<br>      \"right_yellow_block\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Solid yellow rectangle anchoring the bottom-right corner\",<br>        \"label\": \"Call For Details (Dark Grey, Medium)\",<br>        \"phone_number\": \"Phone icon + 0000 0000 0000 (Dark Grey, Bold)\"<br>      }<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>**Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)**<br><br>* **Montserrat Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat)<br>* **Open Sans Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans)<br><br>**Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)**<br><br>* **FontAwesome Official Download**: [https://fontawesome.com/download](https://fontawesome.com/download)<br>* **Gear / Settings Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/settings_126472) | Glyph: `\\f013`<br>* **Globe / Web Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/globe_1006771) | Glyph: `\\f0ac`<br>* **Envelope / Mail Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/email_542689) | Glyph: `\\f0e0`<br>* **Location Pin Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/placeholder_684809) | Glyph: `\\f3c5`<br>* **Phone Call Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/telephone_724664) | Glyph: `\\f095`<br><br>**Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources (Unsplash)**<br><br>* **Corporate Boardroom / Conference Table**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/boardroom](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/boardroom)<br>* **Night City Skyline Aerial View**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/night-city-skyline](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/night-city-skyline)<br><br>---<br><br>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Digital Marketing Agency Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Header &amp; Logo Text<br>│   │   ├── T BRAND NAME<br>│   │   └── T SLOGAN HERE<br>│   ├── 📁 Hero Card Headline<br>│   │   ├── T DIGITAL<br>│   │   ├── T MARKETING<br>│   │   └── T AGENCY<br>│   ├── 📁 Middle Section Text<br>│   │   ├── T Contract<br>│   │   ├── T your number here<br>│   │   ├── T About Us<br>│   │   └── T It has survived not only five centuries... (Paragraph)<br>│   ├── 📁 Service Cards Text<br>│   │   ├── 📁 Card 1 (Business Concept)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Business<br>│   │   │   ├── T Concept<br>│   │   │   └── T It has survived not only five centuries...<br>│   │   ├── 📁 Card 2 (Market Analysis)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Market<br>│   │   │   ├── T Analysis<br>│   │   │   └── T It has survived not only five centuries...<br>│   │   └── 📁 Card 3 (Marketing Stetegy)<br>│   │       ├── T Marketing<br>│   │       ├── T Stetegy<br>│   │       └── T It has survived not only five centuries...<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Text<br>│       ├── T yourname@gmail.com<br>│       ├── T www.websitename.com<br>│       ├── T your address here 1<br>│       ├── T your address here 2<br>│       ├── T Call For Details<br>│       └── T 0000 0000 0000<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 Header Logo Icon (Yellow Rounded Box Badge)<br>│   ├── 📁 Service Card Icons (Gear, Globe, Envelope)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Icons (Email, Web, Pin, Phone)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Top-Right Boardroom Image - Double Click to Edit<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Left Hero City Night Image - Double Click to Edit<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Hero City Rounded Card Mask &amp; Dark Overlay<br>│   ├── 🎨 Headline Yellow Underline Bar<br>│   ├── 🎨 Boardroom Wave Vector Masks &amp; Yellow Accent Swirls<br>│   ├── 🎨 Yellow Contact Capsule (\'Contract\')<br>│   ├── 🎨 About Us Yellow Divider Line<br>│   ├── 📁 Service Cards Containers<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Card 1 Dark Slate Rounded Box (#232F3E)<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Card 2 Dark Slate Rounded Box (#232F3E)<br>│   │   └── 🎨 Card 3 Dark Slate Rounded Box (#232F3E)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Footer Dark Slate Pill Base<br>│   └── 🎨 Footer Bottom-Right Yellow Block<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid White Canvas Base (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Freepik Approval Quality Checklist**<br><br>* **Smart Objects:** Convert both photographic frames (Top-Right Boardroom and Left City Night view) into dedicated **Smart Objects** clipped to vector masks labeled *\"Double Click to Edit\"*.<br>* **True Vectors:** Construct the service cards, yellow contact capsule, footer pill containers, and sweeping wave accents strictly using Photoshop Vector Shape Tools (`U`).<br>* **Editable Typography:** Keep all headline layers, bullet copy, and contact data as live, unrasterized type layers mapped to Montserrat and Open Sans.<br>* **Pre-Press Standards:** Verify the final canvas resolution is **300 DPI**, color profile is set to **CMYK**, and design elements bleed 3mm over all edges.</p>', NULL, '[\"uploads/task_images/task_6a8d086de3bd5.webp\"]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8d097a3732d.webp\"]', '[\"https://dribbble.com/shots/23752080-Creative-Flyer-Design\"]', 1, 6, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 16905, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xqFjK2MAbKnhF6von-ecz2chrgruy6zf?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:42:51', '2026-08-26 07:04:01', '2026-08-25 10:32:03', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-26 07:04:01', NULL, NULL),
(189, 'FLYER 05', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Real Estate Sales\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary\": \"#2ECC71\",<br>    \"secondary\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"accent\": \"#27AE60\",<br>    \"text_dark\": \"#1F2937\",<br>    \"text_light\": \"#F9FAFB\",<br>    \"background\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 700, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main headlines, sub-headlines, badges\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Inter\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 500],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body text, list bullets, contact details\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"header_section\": { \"description\": \"Top brand identity bar with logo mark and contact pill\", \"elements\": {\"logo\": \"Vector Group\", \"contact\": \"Phone &amp; Email\"} },<br>    \"hero_section\": { \"description\": \"Large angled hexagon Smart Object mask with main headline overlay\", \"elements\": {\"photo_mask\": \"Vector Polygon\", \"title\": \"Bold Headline\"} },<br>    \"middle_content\": { \"description\": \"Feature list with icons and description text\", \"elements\": {\"features\": [\"5 Bedroom\", \"Guest Room\", \"Water Pool\", \"Living Room\", \"Open Kitchen\", \"Laundry Room\"] } },<br>    \"footer_section\": { \"description\": \"Dark footer wave container with special price and call-to-action\", \"elements\": {\"price\": \"Special Price\", \"cta\": \"Contact Number\"} }<br>  }<br>}<br>```<br><br>```text<br>**Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)**<br>* **Montserrat**: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat<br>* **Inter**: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter<br><br>**Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)**<br>* **FontAwesome Official Download**: https://fontawesome.com/download<br>* **5 Bedroom Icon**: https://www.flaticon.com/search?word=bedroom | Glyph: \\f0c0<br>* **Guest Room Icon**: https://www.flaticon.com/search?word=guest+room | Glyph: \\f0c1<br>* **Water Pool Icon**: https://www.flaticon.com/search?word=water+pool | Glyph: \\f0c2<br>* **Living Room Icon**: https://www.flaticon.com/search?word=living+room | Glyph: \\f0c3<br>* **Open Kitchen Icon**: https://www.flaticon.com/search?word=kitchen | Glyph: \\f0c4<br>* **Laundry Room Icon**: https://www.flaticon.com/search?word=laundry | Glyph: \\f0c5<br>* **Social / Contact Icons**: Flaticon SVG Links with standard Glyphs (\\f09d FB, \\f16d IG, \\f099 Twitter, \\f09a LinkedIn, \\f095 Phone, \\f0e0 Mail, \\f3c5 Pin)<br><br>**Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources (Unsplash)**<br>* **House Exterior**: https://unsplash.com/s/photos/house<br>* **Interior Living Room**: https://unsplash.com/s/photos/living-room<br>* **Kitchen**: https://unsplash.com/s/photos/kitchen<br>```<br><br>```text<br>📁 Modern Home For Sale - RealEstate<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Header Text (Brand, Taglines)<br>│   ├── 📁 Main Headline (Titles, Sub-headlines)<br>│   ├── 📁 Content / Service Body Text (Columns, Bullets)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer &amp; Contact Info (Phone, Email, URL)<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 Brand Logo Icon / Badge<br>│   ├── 📁 Category &amp; Feature Icons (5 Bedroom, Guest Room, Water Pool, Living Room, Open Kitchen, Laundry Room)<br>│   └── 📁 Social Media &amp; QR Code Placeholder<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── 🖼️ Main Hero Image - Hexagon Photo (Replace Here)<br>│   └── 🖼️ Secondary Image Placeholders (if any)<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Header Geometric Shapes / Accent Tabs<br>│   ├── 🎨 Hexagon Mask / Photo Frame<br>│   ├── 🎨 Feature Badges (50% Discount badge)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Content Cards / Container Boxes<br>│   └── 🎨 Footer Wave / Block Shapes<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid Base Canvas (#FFFFFF)<br>```<br><br>* **Smart Objects:** All photos in 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS must be Smart Objects clipped to vector masks labeled \"Double Click to Edit\".<br>* **True Vectors:** All waves, badges, card containers, and dividing lines in 05_VECTOR_SHAPES must use non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (U).<br>* **Editable Typography:** Keep all text layers live, unrasterized, and paired with free Google Fonts.<br>* **Pre-Press Setup:** Document mode must be CMYK / 300 DPI with an exact 3mm bleed on all 4 canvas margins.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8d6955b3f42.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/business-flyer-template_4009892.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=4&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 6, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'In Review', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 151244, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xqFjK2MAbKnhF6von-ecz2chrgruy6zf?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:43:29', '2026-08-27 04:09:11', '2026-08-27 04:09:11', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `title`, `description`, `checklists`, `ref_image`, `visual_image`, `ref_links`, `created_by`, `assigned_to`, `category`, `department_id`, `priority`, `status`, `is_self_created`, `timer_status`, `session_start_time`, `total_time_spent`, `submission_link`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `submitted_at`, `rejection_reason`, `rejection_image`, `assign_date`, `deadline`, `deadline_time`, `reviewed_by`, `reviewed_at`, `rejected_by`, `rejected_at`) VALUES
(190, 'FLYER 06', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Travel Agency Flight Sale A4 Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_orange\": \"#FF7A00\",<br>    \"secondary_deep_blue\": \"#0A4DA2\",<br>    \"text_dark\": \"#1A1A1A\",<br>    \"text_body_grey\": \"#666666\",<br>    \"text_white\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 700, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main headline, discount badge, destination titles, logo\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Destination descriptions, booking period, contact info\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"header_and_hero_section\": {<br>      \"top_right_logo\": {<br>        \"icon\": \"Geometric split triangle wedge (Orange and Black)\",<br>        \"brand_name\": \"TOUR N\' TRAVEL (Black, Bold)\"<br>      },<br>      \"headline_block\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Upper-left quadrant over solid orange background\",<br>        \"line_1\": \"Cabin Fever? (Black, Heavy Italic)\",<br>        \"line_2\": \"Flights on sale!! (Black, Heavy Italic)\"<br>      },<br>      \"background_geometry\": \"Diagonal orange (#FF7A00) dynamic cross-band with smooth curved corner transitions\"<br>    },<br>    \"geometric_image_composition\": {<br>      \"layout\": \"Overlapping rounded diamond / rhombus layout\",<br>      \"main_image_diamond\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large 45-degree rotated rectangle with rounded corners\",<br>        \"content\": \"Colorful tropical kayaks/canoes on a sandy beach by turquoise ocean water\",<br>        \"border\": \"Thick white outline border\"<br>      },<br>      \"secondary_image_diamond\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Medium rounded diamond intersecting the lower-right of the main image\",<br>        \"content\": \"Serene mountain fjord lake with a small wooden rowboat reflection\",<br>        \"border\": \"Thick white outline border\"<br>      },<br>      \"promo_badge_diamond\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Deep blue (#0A4DA2) rounded diamond badge overlapping the top-right of the hero image\",<br>        \"border\": \"Thick white outline border\",<br>        \"title\": \"Discount (White, Bold)\",<br>        \"amount\": \"up to $500 (White, Heavy Bold)\",<br>        \"sub_tag\": \"Booking Periode: / 3-11 Sept 2021 (White, Italic)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"destinations_three_columns\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Lower section on solid white canvas\",<br>      \"dividers\": \"Two vertical thin grey/black lines separating the destination blocks\",<br>      \"columns\": [<br>        {<br>          \"title\": \"AUSTRALIA (Black, Bold Italic)\",<br>          \"description\": \"Adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"title\": \"GERMANY (Black, Bold Italic)\",<br>          \"description\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"title\": \"INDONESIA (Black, Bold Italic)\",<br>          \"description\": \"Adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore.\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"footer_contact_row\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Bottom margin, horizontally distributed\",<br>      \"left_contact\": \"WhatsApp / Phone icon + 000 1234 567 89\",<br>      \"center_contact\": \"Email icon + travel_admin@email.com\",<br>      \"right_contact\": \"Globe / Web icon + www.travelnow.com\"<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>**Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)**<br><br>* **Montserrat Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat)<br>* **Open Sans Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans)<br><br>**Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)**<br><br>* **FontAwesome Official Download**: [https://fontawesome.com/download](https://fontawesome.com/download)<br>* **Phone / WhatsApp Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/whatsapp_733585) | Glyph: `\\f232`<br>* **Email Envelope Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/email_542689) | Glyph: `\\f0e0`<br>* **Globe / Web Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/globe_1006771) | Glyph: `\\f0ac`<br><br>**Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources (Unsplash)**<br><br>* **Tropical Beach Kayaks / Ocean**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/beach-kayak](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://unsplash.com/s/photos/beach-kayak)<br>* **Mountain Fjord Lake &amp; Rowboat**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/mountain-lake-boat](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://unsplash.com/s/photos/mountain-lake-boat)<br><br>---<br><br>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Travel Flight Sale Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Brand &amp; Headline Text<br>│   │   ├── T TOUR N\' TRAVEL<br>│   │   ├── T Cabin Fever?<br>│   │   └── T Flights on sale!!<br>│   ├── 📁 Discount Badge Text<br>│   │   ├── T Discount<br>│   │   ├── T up to $500<br>│   │   ├── T Booking Periode:<br>│   │   └── T 3-11 Sept 2021<br>│   ├── 📁 Destination Columns Text<br>│   │   ├── T AUSTRALIA &amp; Description<br>│   │   ├── T GERMANY &amp; Description<br>│   │   └── T INDONESIA &amp; Description<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Contact Text<br>│       ├── T 000 1234 567 89<br>│       ├── T travel_admin@email.com<br>│       └── T www.travelnow.com<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 Brand Logo Icon (Orange &amp; Black Triangles)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Icons (Phone, Email, Globe)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   ├── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Beach Kayaks Photo - Replace Here<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Fjord Lake Photo - Replace Here<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Promo Badge Diamond Base (#0A4DA2 + White Stroke)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Main Image Rounded Diamond Mask (White Border Frame)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Secondary Image Rounded Diamond Mask (White Border Frame)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Column Vertical Divider Lines (x2)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Top Diagonal Orange Background Shape (#FF7A00)<br>│   └── 🎨 Bottom Right Orange Corner Accent Shape<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid White Canvas Base (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Freepik Approval Quality Checklist**<br><br>* **Smart Objects:** Both the beach kayak photo and fjord lake photo must be placed in separate **Smart Objects** clipped to rounded diamond vector masks labeled *\"Double Click to Edit\"*.<br>* **True Vectors:** Construct the diagonal orange header shapes, diamond badge containers, white border frames, and corner accents using Photoshop Vector Shape Tools (`U`).<br>* **Editable Typography:** Keep all headline layers, promo text, and destination columns fully unrasterized and paired with Montserrat and Open Sans.<br>* **Pre-Press Setup:** Configure the master PSD file to **CMYK / 300 DPI** with a standard **3mm bleed** on all outer edges.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8fc25edbd18.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/travel-sale-flyer-illustration_9728684.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=5&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 6, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'In Progress', 0, 'Running', '2026-08-27 04:52:09', 0, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xqFjK2MAbKnhF6von-ecz2chrgruy6zf?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:44:25', '2026-08-27 04:52:09', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
