(205, 'FLYER 21', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Corporate Business A4 Flyer Template\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_purple\": \"#7A418B\",<br>    \"secondary_dark_purple\": \"#4B255D\",<br>    \"accent_orange\": \"#E99B16\",<br>    \"accent_red\": \"#B34A5F\",<br>    \"accent_light_blue\": \"#6DB8CA\",<br>    \"accent_green\": \"#68B97D\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 700, 800],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main headlines, prominent titles, button text\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body paragraphs, small descriptive text\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"top_header\": {<br>      \"background_shape\": \"Sweeping white curve in the top-left corner\",<br>      \"logo\": {<br>        \"icon\": \"Geometric overlapping square/star icon (purple and orange)\",<br>        \"brand_name\": \"YOUR COMPANY\",<br>        \"slogan\": \"LOREM IPSUM DOLOR SIT AMET\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"hero_section\": {<br>      \"image\": \"Skyscraper/modern office building looking up at the sky\",<br>      \"mask\": \"Large sweeping concave curve at the bottom, separating it from the purple body\",<br>      \"overlay_text\": {<br>        \"line_1\": \"FLYER (Bold, large, dark purple)\",<br>        \"line_2\": \"TEMPLATE (Regular weight, dark purple, aligned left under FLYER)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_infographic_cards\": {<br>      \"layout\": \"Four rectangular cards horizontally aligned, overlapping the boundary between the top image and the purple background\",<br>      \"cards\": [<br>        {<br>          \"theme_color\": \"Orange\",<br>          \"icon\": \"Globe\",<br>          \"title\": \"Lorem Ipsum\",<br>          \"body\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...\",<br>          \"footer\": \"Lorem Ipsum dolor\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"theme_color\": \"Red\",<br>          \"icon\": \"Gear\",<br>          \"title\": \"Lorem Ipsum\",<br>          \"body\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...\",<br>          \"footer\": \"Lorem Ipsum dolor\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"theme_color\": \"Light Blue\",<br>          \"icon\": \"Key\",<br>          \"title\": \"Lorem Ipsum\",<br>          \"body\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...\",<br>          \"footer\": \"Lorem Ipsum dolor\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"theme_color\": \"Green\",<br>          \"icon\": \"Map Pin\",<br>          \"title\": \"Lorem Ipsum\",<br>          \"body\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...\",<br>          \"footer\": \"Lorem Ipsum dolor\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"lower_content_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"Solid purple with subtle darker purple wave/curve overlays for depth\",<br>      \"heading\": \"Lorem Ipsum dolor (White, centered, bold)\",<br>      \"body_text\": \"Two columns of white dummy text\",<br>      \"contact_and_social_bar\": {<br>        \"call_button\": \"Dark purple rounded pill shape with white text \'CALL NOW\' and a white inner section for the number \'123 4567897\'\",<br>        \"social_links\": \"Text \'follow us:\' with three white circular icons (Twitter, Instagram, Facebook)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"background\": \"Solid White\",<br>      \"left_text\": \"Small paragraph of dummy text\",<br>      \"right_logo\": \"Duplicated logo (YOUR COMPANY)\",<br>      \"bottom_center\": \"WWW.COMPANYDOMAIN.COM\"<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>### **Freepik PSD A4 Blueprint: Corporate Flyer**<br><br>Per your master rule, I am forcing the analysis of this specific design into the exact 10-folder structural blueprint you established, retaining your exact spelling conventions (`OFFERE`, `Dubble Click Here`, `For sale &amp; Prize`, etc.).<br><br>Elements of this purple corporate flyer have been logically mapped into your rigid folder framework (e.g., the 4 infographic cards are placed into the `Small Image` hierarchy, and the \"CALL NOW\" pill is mapped to the `QR Code` group).<br><br>**Your Master Layer Group Hierarchy**📁 [Template] - Corporate Business Flyer (Purple)<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Header &amp; Hero Text<br>│   │   ├── T YOUR COMPANY<br>│   │   ├── T LOREM IPSUM DOLOR SIT AMET<br>│   │   ├── T FLYER<br>│   │   └── T TEMPLATE<br>│   ├── 📁 Infographic Cards Text<br>│   │   ├── 📁 Card 1 (Orange)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem Ipsum (Title)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Body)<br>│   │   │   └── T Lorem Ipsum dolor (Footer)<br>│   │   ├── 📁 Card 2 (Red)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem Ipsum (Title)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Body)<br>│   │   │   └── T Lorem Ipsum dolor (Footer)<br>│   │   ├── 📁 Card 3 (Light Blue)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem Ipsum (Title)<br>│   │   │   ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Body)<br>│   │   │   └── T Lorem Ipsum dolor (Footer)<br>│   │   └── 📁 Card 4 (Green)<br>│   │       ├── T Lorem Ipsum (Title)<br>│   │       ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Body)<br>│   │       └── T Lorem Ipsum dolor (Footer)<br>│   ├── 📁 Lower Paragraphs<br>│   │   ├── T Lorem Ipsum dolor (Main Heading)<br>│   │   ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Left Column)<br>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Right Column)<br>│   ├── 📁 Contact Bar<br>│   │   ├── T CALL NOW<br>│   │   ├── T 123 4567897<br>│   │   └── T follow us:<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Text<br>│       ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Left Text)<br>│       ├── T YOUR COMPANY<br>│       ├── T LOREM IPSUM DOLOR SIT AMET<br>│       └── T WWW.COMPANYDOMAIN.COM<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_LOGOS<br>│   ├── 📁 Main Header Logo (Overlapping geometric diamonds)<br>│   ├── 📁 Footer Logo (Overlapping geometric diamonds)<br>│   ├── 📁 Card Icons (Globe, Gear, Key, Map Pin)<br>│   └── 📁 Social Media (Twitter, Instagram, Facebook Vectors)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Skyscraper Hero Image - Replace Here<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Top Left White Header Curve<br>│   ├── 🎨 Main Image Mask Sweep (Vector Mask applied to Smart Object)<br>│   ├── 📁 Infographic Card Shapes<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Card 1 (White Base + Orange Header + Drop Shadow)<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Card 2 (White Base + Red Header + Drop Shadow)<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Card 3 (White Base + Blue Header + Drop Shadow)<br>│   │   └── 🎨 Card 4 (White Base + Green Header + Drop Shadow)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Lower Dark Purple Depth Sweeps (Subtle overlapping curves)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Contact Pill - Dark Purple Base (\"CALL NOW\")<br>│   ├── 🎨 Contact Pill - White Base (\"123 4567897\")<br>│   ├── 🎨 Social Media Icon Circles (White)<br>│   └── 🎨 Solid White Footer Block<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid Purple Base Canvas (#7A3E8A)<br><br></p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8bcc8494c42.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/modern-business-flyer-with-abstract-design_3410350.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=22&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 5, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Rejected', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 7797, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nTfABCYvfmLrds7sszmXH_UB1GLAVDR2?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:56:46', '2026-08-26 08:53:21', '2026-08-24 08:39:51', 'Some requested assets/files are missing from the submission. Please in