usinessman-laptop)</p><br><p>* **Corporate Office Executive with Reports**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/corporate-worker](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/corporate-worker)</p><br><br><p>---</p><br><br><p>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**</p><br><br><p>```text</p><br><p>📁 [Template] - Corporate Business Flyer (Green)</p><br><p>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)</p><br><p>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)</p><br><p>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)</p><br><p>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Header &amp; Logo Text</p><br><p>│   │   └── T COMPANY</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Chart Text</p><br><p>│   │   ├── T LOREM</p><br><p>│   │   └── T IPSUM</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Main Headlines</p><br><p>│   │   ├── T BUSINESS</p><br><p>│   │   ├── T FLYER</p><br><p>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Intro Paragraph)</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Feature List Items</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 📁 Point 01</p><br><p>│   │   │   ├── T LOREM IPSUM (Title)</p><br><p>│   │   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Description)</p><br><p>│   │   └── 📁 Point 02</p><br><p>│   │       ├── T LOREM IPSUM (Title)</p><br><p>│   │       └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Description)</p><br><p>│   └── 📁 Footer Text</p><br><p>│       └── T mybusiness.com</p><br><p>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Header Logo Icon (White circle \'C\' emblem)</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 User Profile Vector Icon (Green)</p><br><p>│   └── 📁 Email Envelope Vector Icon (Green)</p><br><p>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)</p><br><p>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Circular Hero (Businessman at Desk) - Replace Here</p><br><p>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES</p><br><p>│   ├── 🎨 Hero Concentric Border Rings (Dark Green &amp; Lime Green)</p><br><p>│   ├── 🎨 Hero Swirling Leaf Vector Accents</p><br><p>│   ├── 📁 Donut Chart Segments</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 🎨 Segment 01 - Light Green (#72BF44)</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 🎨 Segment 02 - Dark Green (#0F5A38)</p><br><p>│   │   ├── 🎨 Segment 03 - Dark Grey (#616161)</p><br><p>│   │   └── 🎨 Segment 04 - Light Grey (#9E9E9E)</p><br><p>│   ├── 🎨 Square Bullet Markers (2x Lime Green Dots)</p><br><p>│   ├── 🎨 Top Left Header Wave (Lime to Forest Green Gradient)</p><br><p>│   └── 🎨 Bottom Footer Wave (Forest to Dark Green Gradient)</p><br><p>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND</p><br><p>    └── 🎨 Solid White Canvas Base (#FFFFFF)</p><br><br><p>```</p><br><br><p>**Freepik Approval Quality Checklist**</p><br><br><p>* **Smart Objects:** Convert the circular hero image into a dedicated **Smart Object** clipped to a circular vector mask labeled *\"Double Click to Edit\"*.</p><br><p>* **True Vectors:** Construct the multi-segmented donut chart, outer concentric decorative rings, bullet squares, and flowing wave headers strictly using non-destructive Vector Shape Tools (`U`).</p><br><p>* **Editable Typography:** Maintain all headlines, multi-line intro paragraphs, and feature item texts as live, unflattened type layers paired with Google Fonts.</p><br><p>* **Pre-Press Setup:** Build the canvas to **CMYK / 300 DPI** with a full **3mm bleed** boundary extending beyond the final trim line.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8c237c5c806.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/abstract-business-flyer-template_5464214.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=20&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 5, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Rejected', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 9816, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1d-SnHquLgNElnY72gI9Ekh-iwXuJ6cpR?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:57:26', '2026-08-26 08:53:21', '2026-08-25 06:21:04', 'Please fix the alignment and spacing issues across the main layout. Ensure margins are consistent.', NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-25 10:17:20'),
(207, 'FLYER 23', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Retail Shopping Big Sale Flyer - Modern Split Grid Variant\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_orange\": \"#FF6B00\",<br>    \"gradient_pink_magenta\": \"#E61C66\",<br>    \"accent_yellow\": \"#FFC107\",<br>    \"dark_card_bg\": \"#1E1E24\",<br>    \"text_dark\": \"#2B2B2B\",<br>    \"text_body_grey\": \"#666666\",<br>    \"text_white\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600, 700, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Headlines, discount badge, call-to-action cards, brand name\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body paragraphs, service descriptions, URLs\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"top_header_bar\": {<br>      \"style\": \"Clean horizontal header split\",<br>      \"left_brand\": \"Six-dot grid icon + YOUR LOGO (Dark Grey &amp; Orange)\",<br>      \"right_contact\": \"CALL US: +012 345 678 90 (Bold Orange) | www.yourwebsite.com\"<br>    },<br>    \"hero_and_promo_split\": {<br>      \"layout\": \"50/50 vertical split across the upper canvas\",<br>      \"left_hero_card\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Vertical rounded rectangle card with clipped photograph\",<br>        \"image_content\": \"Smiling young woman carrying shopping bags and looking at her smartphone\",<br>        \"floating_badge\": \"50% OFF circular badge pinned to the bottom-right corner of the image card\"<br>      },<br>      \"right_headline_block\": {<br>        \"title_group\": \"BIG SALE (Heavy Orange) / A5 FLYER TEMPLATE (Dark Slate)\",<br>        \"headline_sub\": \"HEADLINE\\nTAGLINE GOES HERE (Italic)\",<br>        \"paragraph\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consec tetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolo re magna aliqua.\",<br>        \"icon_strip\": \"Three horizontal pill badges with Dollar, Search, and Award icons\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_services_grid\": {<br>      \"heading\": \"OUR SERVICES (Orange, Centered, Bold)\",<br>      \"layout\": \"Three horizontal modular cards with subtle drop shadows\",<br>      \"cards\": [<br>        {<br>          \"number_badge\": \"01 (Pink-to-Orange gradient pill)\",<br>          \"title\": \"Lorem ipsum (Dark Grey, Bold)\",<br>          \"text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consec tetur adipiscing elitine, sed magnas eiusmod tempor.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"number_badge\": \"02 (Pink-to-Orange gradient pill)\",<br>          \"title\": \"Lorem ipsum (Dark Grey, Bold)\",<br>          \"text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consec tetur adipiscing elitine, sed magnas eiusmod tempor.\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"number_badge\": \"03 (Pink-to-Orange gradient pill)\",<br>          \"title\": \"Lorem ipsum (Dark Grey, Bold)\",<br>          \"text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consec tetur adipiscing elitine, sed magnas.\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    },<br>    \"bottom_action_footer\": {<br>      \"shape\": \"Full-width dark slate (#1E1E24) container with rounded top corners\",<br>      \"left_label\": \"CONTACT US (White, Bold, Uppercase)\",<br>      \"social_links\": \"Circular white icon buttons for Location Pin, Facebook, and Email\",<br>      \"accent_border\": \"Thin orange-to-yellow gradient top border stroke\"<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>**Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)**<br><br>* **Montserrat Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat)<br>* **Open Sans Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans)<br><br>**Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)**<br><br>* **FontAwesome Official Download**: [https://fontawesome.com/download](https://fontawesome.com/download)<br>* **Shopping / Dollar Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/dollar-symbol_3135706) | Glyph: `\\f155`<br>* **Search / Magnifier Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/search_622669) | Glyph: `\\f002`<br>* **Award Ribbon Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/ribbon_3176396) | Glyph: `\\f5a0`<br>* **Location Pin Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/placeholder_684809) | Glyph: `\\f3c5`<br>* **Facebook Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/facebook-app-symbol_2111392) | Glyph: `\\f39e`<br>* **Email Envelope Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/email_542689) | Glyph: `\\f0e0`<br><br>**Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources (Unsplash)**<br><br>* **Woman Shopping with Phone &amp; Bags**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/woman-shopping-city](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://unsplash.com/s/photos/woman-shopping-city)<br>* **Modern Retail Shopping Street**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/shopping-bags](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/shopping-bags)<br><br>---<br><br>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Retail Big Sale Flyer (Grid Variant)<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Top Bar Text<br>│   │   ├── T YOUR LOGO<br>│   │   ├── T CALL US: +012 345 678 90<br>│   │   └── T www.yourwebsite.com<br>│   ├── 📁 Hero Column Text<br>│   │   ├── T BIG SALE<br>│   │   ├── T A5 FLYER TEMPLATE<br>│   │   ├── T HEADLINE<br>│   │   ├── T TAGLINE GOES HERE<br>│   │   ├── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet...<br>│   │   └── T LOREM IPSUM (Labels x3)<br>│   ├── 📁 Promo Badge Text<br>│   │   ├── T 50%<br>│   │   └── T OFF<br>│   ├── 📁 Services Grid Text<br>│   │   ├── T OUR SERVICES<br>│   │   ├── T 01 / Lorem ipsum &amp; Text<br>│   │   ├── T 02 / Lorem ipsum &amp; Text<br>│   │   └── T 03 / Lorem ipsum &amp; Text<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Bar Text<br>│       └── T CONTACT US<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 Logo 6-Dot Grid Icon<br>│   ├── 📁 3x Mini Category Icons (Dollar, Magnifier, Award)<br>│   └── 📁 3x Footer Social Icons (Pin, Facebook, Email)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Left Hero Image - Replace Here<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Hero Card Container (Rounded Rectangle Mask)<br>│   ├── 📁 50% OFF Badge Group<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Badge Base Circle (Pink-to-Orange Gradient)<br>│   │   └── 🎨 Badge Outer Ring (White Stroke + Shadow)<br>│   ├── 🎨 3x Mini Feature Icon Pill Bases<br>│   ├── 📁 3x Service Card Rectangles<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Card 01 Base (White Shape + Drop Shadow)<br>│   │   ├── 🎨 Card 02 Base (White Shape + Drop Shadow)<br>│   │   └── 🎨 Card 03 Base (White Shape + Drop Shadow)<br>│   ├── 🎨 3x Number Badges (Pink-Orange Gradient)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Dark Footer Bar Base (#1E1E24)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Footer Top Gradient Accent Line<br>│   └── 🎨 3x Social Icon Circular Buttons (White)<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid Base Canvas (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Freepik Approval Quality Checklist**<br><br>* **Smart Objects:** The shopping image is placed in a vertical **Smart Object** card clipped with rounded corners labeled *\"Double Click to Edit\"*.<br>* **True Vectors:** All modular service cards, rounded image frames, badge pills, and dark footer containers are constructed using Photoshop Vector Shape Tools (`U`).<br>* **Editable Typography:** Keep all headline layers, numbered list descriptions, and contact info fully unrasterized and paired with Montserrat and Open Sans.<br>* **Pre-Press Compliance:** Set document color space to **CMYK / 300 DPI** with a **3mm bleed** boundary on all sides.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8d13e71bec4.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/free-vector/sales-a5-flyer-with-photo-template_15569922.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=21&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 5, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 7325, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ek_mUOuh32AgPJ_Fqn0Wgs_7urwECgFY?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:58:10', '2026-08-26 07:02:25', '2026-08-25 10:28:14', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-26 07:02:25', NULL, NULL);
