(208, 'FLYER 24', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Travel &amp; Tour Agency A4 Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset (Print Ready)\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_magenta\": \"#8A005D\",<br>    \"secondary_dark_purple\": \"#5A003D\",<br>    \"accent_orange\": \"#FF8C00\",<br>    \"accent_yellow\": \"#FFD700\",<br>    \"text_dark_magenta\": \"#8A005D\",<br>    \"text_body_grey\": \"#666666\",<br>    \"text_white\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 700, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main headlines, discount badge, button labels, phone number\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Great Vibes\",<br>        \"weights\": [400],<br>        \"usage\": \"Script kicker tagline (\'Discover Your Next Adventure\')\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body text, section descriptions, sub-headings\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"header_and_hero_section\": {<br>      \"top_right_logo\": {<br>        \"text\": \"LOGO HERE (Magenta &amp; Dark Grey)\"<br>      },<br>      \"upper_left_magenta_badge\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large rounded organic container with an orange stroke outline in the upper-left quadrant\",<br>        \"kicker\": \"Discover Your Next Adventure (Yellow, Script)\",<br>        \"headline_line_1\": \"EXPLORE (White, Extra Bold)\",<br>        \"headline_line_2\": \"THE (White, Outlined/Hollow font style)\",<br>        \"headline_line_3\": \"WORLD (White, Heavy Bold)\",<br>        \"headline_sub\": \"WITH US! (White, Bold)\",<br>        \"intro_text\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh...\"<br>      },<br>      \"airplane_flight_trail\": {<br>        \"icon\": \"Orange airplane silhouette\",<br>        \"path\": \"Dotted looped flight path spanning the top-right white space\"<br>      },<br>      \"hero_image_mask\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large sweeping organic wave mask in the lower-right area with orange and cyan vector accent borders\",<br>        \"content_description\": \"Female traveler smiling on a tropical long-tail wooden boat holding a camera on turquoise water\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_content_section\": {<br>      \"discount_badge\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Middle-left white area\",<br>        \"line_1\": \"UP TO 50% (Magenta, Bold)\",<br>        \"line_2\": \"DISCOUNT (Dark Magenta, Bold)\"<br>      },<br>      \"services_block\": {<br>        \"title\": \"Our Services (Magenta, Bold)\",<br>        \"underline\": \"Thin orange horizontal line\",<br>        \"body_paragraphs\": \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat volutpat...\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"footer_section\": {<br>      \"left_orange_wave\": \"Sweeping orange vector curve anchoring the bottom-left edge\",<br>      \"call_to_action_bar\": {<br>        \"button\": \"Magenta gradient pill shape with \'BOOK NOW\' (White, Bold)\",<br>        \"phone_icon\": \"Magenta rounded circle with white phone handset icon\",<br>        \"phone_details\": \"FOR DETAILS (Dark Grey, Small)\\n00 000 0000 (Black/Dark Magenta, Bold)\"<br>      },<br>      \"qr_code\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Bottom-right corner\",<br>        \"frame\": \"Square QR code container with a magenta outer stroke border\"<br>      },<br>      \"bottom_magenta_band\": \"Thin magenta curved footer line along the bottom margin\"<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>**Free Font Download Links (Google Fonts)**<br><br>* **Montserrat Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat)<br>* **Great Vibes Font (Script)**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Great+Vibes](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Great+Vibes)<br>* **Open Sans Font Family**: [https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans](https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans)<br><br>**Icon Links &amp; Glyph Codes (Photoshop / Illustrator)**<br><br>* **FontAwesome Official Download**: [https://fontawesome.com/download](https://fontawesome.com/download)<br>* **Airplane Flying Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/airplane_723955) | Glyph: `\\f072`<br>* **Phone Call Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/telephone_724664) | Glyph: `\\f095`<br>* **Camera / Travel Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/camera_685655) | Glyph: `\\f030`<br>* **QR Code Frame Icon**: [Flaticon SVG Link](https://www.flaticon.com/free-icon/qr-code_714390) | Glyph: `\\f029`<br><br>**Commercial-Use Placeholder Image Sources (Unsplash)**<br><br>* **Tropical Boat Travel / Tourist with Camera**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/tropical-boat-travel](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://unsplash.com/s/photos/tropical-boat-travel)<br>* **Island Exploration &amp; Vacation**: [https://unsplash.com/s/photos/thailand-travel](https://unsplash.com/s/photos/thailand-travel)<br><br>---<br><br>**Photoshop Layer Group Hierarchy**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Travel Explore The World Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin (210x297mm)<br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin (5mm inside trim)<br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Header &amp; Logo Text<br>│   │   ├── T LOGO<br>│   │   └── T HERE<br>│   ├── 📁 Hero Main Headline (Upper Container)<br>│   │   ├── T Discover Your Next Adventure (Script)<br>│   │   ├── T EXPLORE<br>│   │   ├── T THE (Outlined Style)<br>│   │   ├── T WORLD<br>│   │   ├── T WITH US!<br>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Intro text)<br>│   ├── 📁 Middle Section Text<br>│   │   ├── T UP TO 50%<br>│   │   ├── T DISCOUNT<br>│   │   ├── T Our Services<br>│   │   └── T Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet... (Body paragraphs)<br>│   └── 📁 Footer Contact Info<br>│       ├── T BOOK NOW<br>│       ├── T FOR DETAILS<br>│       └── T 00 000 0000<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 Airplane Icon &amp; Dotted Flight Trail<br>│   ├── 📁 Phone Handset Icon (White)<br>│   └── 📁 QR Code (Smart Object + Magenta Border Frame)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Tropical Travel Photo - Double Click to Edit<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Hero Magenta Container Shape (#8A005D)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Hero Container Orange Outer Accent Stroke<br>│   ├── 🎨 Tropical Photo Curved Wave Mask<br>│   ├── 🎨 Photo Border Accent Strokes (Orange &amp; Cyan Curves)<br>│   ├── 🎨 \'Our Services\' Orange Underline Divider<br>│   ├── 🎨 \'BOOK NOW\' Button Pill (Magenta Gradient)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Phone Icon Circle Button (Magenta Base)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Bottom Left Sweeping Orange Wave<br>│   └── 🎨 Bottom Base Magenta Footer Wave<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid White Canvas Base (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Freepik Approval Quality Checklist**<br><br>* **Smart Objects:** Ensure the tropical boat travel image is embedded inside a dedicated **Smart Object** clipped to the organic vector wave mask labeled *\"Double Click to Edit\"*.<br>* **True Vectors:** Draw the upper-left container, airplane dotted flight trail, curved framing strokes, action buttons, and bottom waves using Photoshop Vector Shape Tools (`U`).<br>* **Editable Typography:** Keep all typography live and unrasterized—including the script headline *\"Discover Your Next Adventure\"* and outlined *\"THE\"* font effect.<br>* **Pre-Press Setup:** Configure the master document color mode to **CMYK / 300 DPI** with a full **3mm bleed** boundary on all outer dimensions.</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8d74378badf.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/premium-psd/minimalist-travel-flyer-vacation-offers_410061124.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=27&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 5, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'In Review', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 57828, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KRCntHJPyaQh5P-06KyHj_QzfqpIYEv4?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 03:59:01', '2026-08-27 03:21:17', '2026-08-27 03:21:17', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
