(215, 'FLYER 31', '<p>```json<br>{<br>  \"canvas_specifications\": {<br>    \"format\": \"A4 Print Flyer\",<br>    \"width_mm\": 210,<br>    \"height_mm\": 297,<br>    \"resolution_dpi\": 300,<br>    \"color_mode\": \"CMYK\",<br>    \"bleed_mm\": 3<br>  },<br>  \"template_type\": \"Corporate Digital Marketing Agency Flyer\",<br>  \"target_platform\": \"Freepik Contributor Asset\",<br>  \"color_scheme\": {<br>    \"primary_deep_blue\": \"#0A3A82\",<br>    \"accent_golden_yellow\": \"#F4B41A\",<br>    \"text_dark_grey\": \"#333333\",<br>    \"text_light_grey\": \"#666666\",<br>    \"background_white\": \"#FFFFFF\",<br>    \"background_light_grey\": \"#F0F0F0\",<br>    \"card_grey\": \"#F4F4F4\"<br>  },<br>  \"typography_specifications\": {<br>    \"fonts_used\": [<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Montserrat\",<br>        \"weights\": [600, 700, 800, 900],<br>        \"usage\": \"Main headlines, pricing, bold titles, logo\"<br>      },<br>      {<br>        \"font_family\": \"Open Sans\",<br>        \"weights\": [400, 600],<br>        \"usage\": \"Body paragraphs, sub-text, contact details\"<br>      }<br>    ]<br>  },<br>  \"layout_sections\": {<br>    \"hero_section\": {<br>      \"layout_style\": \"Geometric chevron/diagonal split\",<br>      \"left_polygon\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Large solid deep blue polygon with an angled right edge, occupying the top-left to middle-left.\",<br>        \"logo_placement\": \"Top-left corner (White and Yellow text with a paper plane icon)\",<br>        \"headline_group\": {<br>          \"text_1\": \"Digital (White, Regular/Light)\",<br>          \"text_2\": \"Marketing (Yellow, Bold)\",<br>          \"text_3\": \"Agency (White, Bold)\",<br>          \"divider\": \"Short horizontal yellow line under the headline\",<br>          \"paragraph\": \"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text... (White)\"<br>        }<br>      },<br>      \"right_image\": {<br>        \"shape\": \"Polygon wedge filling the top-right\",<br>        \"image\": \"Grayscale corporate meeting room\",<br>        \"accent_stroke\": \"Thick golden-yellow chevron/zigzag line outlining the left and bottom edges of the image\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"floating_elements\": {<br>      \"badge\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Intersecting the blue polygon, image, and white background near the center-right\",<br>        \"shape\": \"Solid deep blue circle with a thick yellow outer border and white inner stroke\",<br>        \"text\": \"65% (Yellow) \\n Save (White)\"<br>      },<br>      \"contact_callout\": {<br>        \"position\": \"Lower-left edge of the blue polygon\",<br>        \"shape\": \"Light grey angled rectangle\",<br>        \"icon\": \"Deep blue square with rounded corners containing a white phone icon\",<br>        \"text\": \"CALL TO FIND OUT MORE (Dark Grey) \\n 00 123 456 789 (Deep Blue, Bold)\"<br>      }<br>    },<br>    \"middle_content_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Horizontal band across the lower-middle on white background\",<br>      \"layout\": \"Two-column text split\",<br>      \"left_side\": \"SHARE YOUR\\nCREATIVITY\\nWITH THE WORLD (Black, Right-aligned, Bold)\",<br>      \"divider\": \"Vertical golden-yellow line\",<br>      \"right_side\": \"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text... (Dark Grey, Left-aligned)\"<br>    },<br>    \"bottom_features_section\": {<br>      \"position\": \"Bottom 25% of the flyer\",<br>      \"layout\": \"Three vertical columns with light grey rectangular backgrounds\",<br>      \"columns\": [<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Lightbulb inside a deep blue circle\",<br>          \"title\": \"Business (Black)\",<br>          \"text\": \"It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Bar Chart inside a golden-yellow circle\",<br>          \"title\": \"Promotion (Deep Blue)\",<br>          \"text\": \"It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted\"<br>        },<br>        {<br>          \"icon\": \"Star Ribbon inside a deep blue circle\",<br>          \"title\": \"Security (Black)\",<br>          \"text\": \"It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted\"<br>        }<br>      ]<br>    }<br>  }<br>}<br><br>```<br><br>### **Freepik PSD A4 Blueprint: Logical Grouping Structure**<br><br>Since you requested a departure from the strict master hierarchy used previously, here is a highly optimized, industry-standard layer structure. This format groups elements by their **Photoshop Layer Type** (Text, Vectors, Smart Objects), making it incredibly efficient for end-users to locate and edit specific content without digging through visual quadrant folders.<br><br>**Layer Group Hierarchy Structure**<br><br>```text<br>📁 [Template] - Corporate Digital Marketing Flyer<br>├── 📁 01_BLEED_&amp;_GUIDES (Locked, Non-Printing)<br>│   ├── ▯ Trim Line Margin <br>│   └── ▯ Safe Zone Margin <br>├── 📁 02_TEXT_CONTENT<br>│   ├── 📁 Header &amp; Hero<br>│   │   ├── T CORPORATE AGENCY<br>│   │   ├── T Digital<br>│   │   ├── T Marketing<br>│   │   ├── T Agency<br>│   │   └── T Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text...<br>│   ├── 📁 Contact Callout<br>│   │   ├── T CALL TO FIND OUT MORE<br>│   │   └── T 00 123 456 789<br>│   ├── 📁 Promo Badge<br>│   │   ├── T 65%<br>│   │   └── T Save<br>│   ├── 📁 Middle Section<br>│   │   ├── T SHARE YOUR CREATIVITY...<br>│   │   └── T Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text...<br>│   └── 📁 Bottom Features<br>│       ├── T Business &amp; Description Text<br>│       ├── T Promotion &amp; Description Text<br>│       └── T Security &amp; Description Text<br>├── 📁 03_ICONS_&amp;_BADGES<br>│   ├── 📁 Logo Icon (Paper Plane)<br>│   ├── 📁 Contact Icon (Phone in Blue Box)<br>│   └── 📁 Feature Icons (Bulb, Chart, Star Ribbon)<br>├── 📁 04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS (Smart Objects)<br>│   └── 🖼️ [Smart Object] Main Office Image - Replace Here<br>├── 📁 05_VECTOR_SHAPES<br>│   ├── 🎨 Promo Badge Circles (Blue Base, Yellow &amp; White Strokes)<br>│   ├── 🎨 Yellow Chevron Image Border<br>│   ├── 🎨 Main Deep Blue Polygon Mask<br>│   ├── 🎨 Yellow Headline Divider Line<br>│   ├── 🎨 Light Grey Contact Box<br>│   ├── 🎨 Yellow Vertical Middle Divider<br>│   └── 🎨 Light Grey Feature Card Backgrounds (x3)<br>└── 📁 06_BACKGROUND<br>    └── 🎨 Solid Base Canvas (#FFFFFF)<br><br>```<br><br>**Key Advantages of this Structure:**<br><br>* **Rapid Localization:** A user translating the flyer into another language only needs to open the `02_TEXT_CONTENT` folder.<br>* **Non-Destructive Editing:** By isolating the yellow chevron border and the blue polygon in the `05_VECTOR_SHAPES` folder, the user can easily drop a new image into the `04_IMAGE_PLACEHOLDERS` Smart Object without accidentally overriding the geometric masking effects.<br><br>Would you like me to generate the exact CMYK color codes and recommended typography pairings for this specific layout?</p>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8bd1eb99acc.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/premium-vector/corporate-business-flyer-template-brochure-design-cover-annual-report-poster_353009305.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=30&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 2, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 11688, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1J85yhYHTWIwcSqIFPB7d8ITfTk-Ek9R5?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 04:04:51', '2026-08-26 07:19:47', '2026-08-24 08:28:44', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-25 06:36:42', NULL, NULL);
