margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; marker: none; mask: none; offset: normal; opacity: 1; order: 0; orphans: 2; outline: rgb(31, 31, 31) none 2.5px; overlay: none; padding: 0px; page: auto; perspective: none; position: static; quotes: auto; r: 0px; resize: none; rotate: none; rule: 3.75px rgb(31, 31, 31); rx: auto; ry: auto; scale: none; speak: normal; stroke: none; transform: none; transition: all; translate: none; visibility: visible; widows: 2; x: 0px; y: 0px; zoom: 1; font-family: &quot;Google Sans Text&quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important;\">Clean Vector Management:</b> All shapes, waves, and design accents are grouped together, ensuring that layer styles (like drop shadows or gradients on the waves) can be managed without cluttering the structural text elements.</div></li></ol></div>', NULL, '[]', '[\"uploads\\/task_images\\/task_6a8be94c3bed7.webp\"]', '[\"https://www.magnific.com/premium-psd/business-marketing-flyer-design_24695584.htm#fromView=search&page=1&position=28&uuid=c619f231-b619-4c81-a63d-5429723b16d4&track=ais_hybrid&query=Flyer\"]', 1, 2, 'Graphic Design', 1, 'Medium', 'Completed', 0, 'Stopped', NULL, 17110, 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LFurzyg3t4eeYp5ieSXFIcTWgtzWGxi7?usp=sharing', '2026-08-24 04:14:30', '2026-08-26 07:19:47', '2026-08-24 11:36:24', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-24', NULL, NULL, 10, '2026-08-25 04:15:56', NULL, NULL);
